37	\textbf{Topology} & \textbf{Violation} & \textbf{Sign Flip} & \textbf{Amplif.} & $\tau_{\text{sf}}{=}0$? \\
38	\midrule
39	Confounding & 100\% & 0\% & 100\% & \checkmark$^*$ \\
40	Exposure & 85\% & 83.4\% & 14.1\% & \ding{55} \\
41	Mediation & 100\% & 0\% & 100\% & \checkmark$^*$ \\
